{"type":"after","callId":"call@18","endTime":216244.627,"result":{"matches":true,"received":{"value":{"s":"Scroll Studio Spike — Signhify"},"ariaSnapshot":"- banner:\n  - link \"Signhify AI Engineering Studio Signhify\":\n    - /url: /\n    - img \"Signhify AI Engineering Studio\"\n    - text: Signhify\n  - button \"Toggle menu\"\n- main:\n  - complementary:\n    - text: Scroll Studio Spike Signhify v1.0 · Technical Spike\n    - button \"Reset config\"\n    - text: VISUAL TOKENS\n    - button \"wireframe\"\n    - button \"glowing\"\n    - button \"particle\"\n    - text: Timeline density 150 frames\n    - slider: \"150\"\n    - text: Mock engine color\n    - button\n    - button\n    - button\n    - text: Autoplay preview\n    - button \"Scroll\"\n    - button \"24 FPS\"\n    - text: Welcome to Signhify Scroll Studio Spike! I'm your AI Strategist. Describe style edits (e.g., 'make it a wireframe', 'change color to purple', 'increase frame count to 200') to update the scroll-locked animation engine. 01:37 AM\n    - textbox \"e.g. 'wireframe', 'make it purple'...\"\n    - button\n  - main:\n    - text: LINKED TO SCROLL CONTAINER\n    - button\n    - button\n    - button \"Export ZIP\"\n    - button \"Deploy\"\n    - text: \"FRAME INDEX: 0 FPS CACHE: Scroll driver MEMORY STATE: Bitmaps cached Narrative Steps 01. The Void Awakens 02. Gesture Decoded 03. Translation Bridge 04. Launch Trajectory Scroll Down to Play Story\"\n- contentinfo:\n  - text: Signhify AI Engineering Studio\n  - paragraph: Describe your idea. Signhify builds it. We design, ship, and scale AI-first products end-to-end — from MVP to revenue.\n  - text: Registered MSME · Govt. of India (UDYAM) Studio\n  - list:\n    - listitem:\n      - link \"Services\":\n        - /url: /services\n    - listitem:\n      - link \"Pricing\":\n        - /url: /pricing\n    - listitem:\n      - link \"Projects\":\n        - /url: /projects\n    - listitem:\n      - link \"AI Generator\":\n        - /url: /ai\n    - listi